# Agent tooling (local only, not shared)
# AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md are deliberately NOT ignored: Spec Kit writes the agent
# context file there and its `select` flow maintains a pointer in it, so it is a
# tracked project artifact. `.claude/` stays ignored — its slash commands are
# regenerated by `specify init` and are machine-specific.
.mcp.json
.codex/
.claude/
skills-lock.json
